Package: GIR
Type: Package
Title: Gini Index Regression with Bayesian Bootstrap Inference
Version: 0.2.1
Authors@R: person("David", "Diaz-Villarejo", email = "ddiazvil@eco.uc3m.es", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Fits linear Gini Index Regression models using a least-squares
    series estimator of the conditional mid-distribution function. Provides
    a two-stage Bayesian bootstrap, centered confidence intervals, bootstrap
    standard errors, tests of smooth coefficient transformations, conditional
    Gini predictions and a GIR-specific goodness-of-fit measure. The estimator
    and two-stage bootstrap follow Bhardwaj and Diaz-Villarejo (2026),
    "Gini Index Regression" (working paper, Universidad Carlos III de Madrid)
    <https://ddiazvil.com/assets/papers/JMP_GIR_DiazVillarejo.pdf>.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
